---

<section class="section services" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="container services-inner reveal">
    <div>
      <span class="section-label">Services</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="services-title">Engineering partners, not just vendors.</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Need something custom? We build and ship production software end to end.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="service-list">
      <li>
        <h3>Web platforms</h3>
        <p>Product sites, dashboards, and APIs with realtime features when it matters.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Mobile apps</h3>
        <p>iOS and Android experiences that stay in sync with your backend systems.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Backend systems</h3>
        <p>Databases, auth, messaging, and infrastructure that hold up under real use.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 80% at 100% 50%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.06), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg);
  }

  .services-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .service-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .service-list h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .service-list p {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    max-width: 36ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .services-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
